## Success Criteria

1. `/stage0 "vietnam sourcing agent"` → SIDE_HUSTLE (Q4=NO, Q5=LABOR)
2. `/stage0 "supplier directory SaaS"` → MOUNTAIN_CANDIDATE (Q4=YES, Q5=CODE)
3. `/stage0 "ESG audit → template SaaS"` → SIDE_HUSTLE_WITH_STAIRCASE (Q5=HYBRID)
4. Old verdicts without leverage section → score drops 10-15 pts
5. New verdicts with leverage section → dimension 10-15/15

## Risks

- Hard cap kills legitimate $50K+/mo consulting → acceptable: $50K/mo consulting IS still a job
- Backward compat with existing case JSONs → leverage fields optional, default null
- Audit hook rejects → leverage checks severity=major (not critical) initially
